  m_Name: DragonbornSkymasterSquad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Dragonborn Skymaster Squad
  role: 3
  description: 'Dragonborn shock troops on jetpacks: a Skylord and four Skymasters
    (10 health, Armor Level 2, 75% accuracy). They move 40 m (80 m sprinting), and
    their Jump Packs carry them onto walls, crates and anything else they can climb
    at no extra cost, so they can strike anywhere on the field. Each fires Twin Raptor
    Pistols (2 shots, 4 damage, penetration 1, 20 m), pistols they can still use
    in close range. A Specialist, so you can field more than one.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e59a2f886b0b1ec4ab9439a95779cb59, type: 2}
